{"version":1,"content":"<p>藝人羅子溢及張曦雯（Kelly）於明晚無綫台慶參與遊戲環節演出，前者笑言聽聞勝出者獎金不錯，所以會盡力而為，後者更有機會夥拍羅嘉良負責開場大型舞蹈表演﹕「我哋拍《範圍律師團》嘅時候，佢喺片場都有跳幾吓『難兄難弟』，睇嚟已經俾我哋融化咗。</p><p>（佢</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T11:04:02.909601+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T09:40:55+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T10:57:16.179651+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T10:57:16.179651+00:00","content_hash":"ca3386ee5ca7ed26b1c7d07d8213e8dbe65cbf5ff4a5b9c3e439f4a9f86feb61","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}